          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hám daxta, heewí, tsuunqumiís daanduú gixsár Tirowo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gixsár Tiro tidár afaá tláwtí dirii', ar mukós halaanu'uumár tlehhahhiít dír yaamaá afaá tlawtá wa ale ka beér, Aakoó MUNGÚ i kaahi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Múk Persiár daáhh nee Ludi nee Puti, inooín tina haragaasiyé' nee slaqwaruuseerók, gaambuuín nee kofiyaduín ngiri burumburiyé' baraá slumoowók, kiíng iri iia tleeresiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Arfadi nee oo Hela nee slaqwaruuser'ín ko/uuwók ngina xuné' bihhe sleémeerowo, múk Gamadi maraywók kudá' tlet ngina xuné'. Inooín gaambuuín ngina sihhiyé' bihhe sleémeero awa koo/irók. Gawaá adoorí tiri ló'wa hhohhoeés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Múk yaamaá Tarshishi nee kiíng halaanu'uuma ana tlehhé', asma daqaari'iimarók tidá' a tsiniq, tidár umuú daa'awto. Daqaari'iimár peésa, nee ar muqsla, nee ar baáti nee ar harsaásaay as muruuwók kudá' taa slá' kuwa sleer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Yafani, nee oo Tubali nee oo Mesheki halaanu'uuma ngina tleehhiyé' nee kiíng, inooín tiri muk'ín i weerimiís as kahhó' xooslaarók tidár muqslár sirda/aten kawa slay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwók kudá' ta koon una weeramís dír múk Bet-togarma as farsuú huwa loohiso kuwa sleer nee oo slaqwaraaro, nee angamía nee wayshamaawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Dedani halaanu'uuma gana tleéhh nee kiíng. Yaamaá afkú tlawi an dír kiíng muruuwók kwi weeramaamis. Mukós ina xareemaá daaweérí huúw nee meendáy as tawa bu'utuú muruuwók. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Edomu halaanu'uuma kana tleéhh nee kiíng asma muruú ta weermis ku ló'wa úr. Inooín xooslarók ngina tlaxuné' ar tlaa/aá ta bay akiíki, warqamaá sirda/aten, warqamaá taa qaalín ar kitaánír hhohho' nee tlaa/aá ta bay marijaáni nee awa yakuúti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam múk Yuda nee oo Israeli halaanu'uuma ngina tleehhiyé' nee kiíng. Inooín angaáno nguna hanisiyé', nee seituúni, nee /aantsír aa geerií hamat, nee dane, nee di/i nee mooyángw tsuú', as bu'utuú muruuwók. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Damasko halaanu'uuma gana tleéhh nee kiíng asma muruú yaariír ta koon, asma daqaari'iimár yaariir ar umuú daa'awto. Ina difaáír Helbonír daáhhií hanisiyé', nee se'éngw /awák oo bee/aangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fedani nee Yafani xooslaarók ngina huwiyé' iimír yaamaá Usalír wa ale, tam muqslár taa kwahhuút, dalasiíni nee chaichai as xooslaarók ngiwa slaya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Dedani halaanu'uuma kana tleéhh nee kiíng, as inqwaruú ta gawaá farsií hhafiin kuwa amoorók i weermiisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Ma/araábu nee geeraharuusér yaamaá Kedari sleémeero an múk halaanu'uumár deeloó bee/aangw, nee gwaandaawe nee ar aaraawo aga ló'wa tlehhte'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukdaádá' muruú tlaxuúm oo Sheba nee oo Rama halaanu'uuma ngina tleehhiyé' nee kiíng, muruudá' ta baraá muruú /aymárií qamin nguna huwiyé', nee tlaa/aá tlaxo uren, nee sahaábuwo, xooslaarók tidá' hhohho' kari sláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamulouusér gixsadaá Harani, nee ar Kane nee ar Edeni nee mukduú Ashuru muruú tlaxuuma, nee oo Kilmadi, halaanu'uuma ana tlehhé' nee kiíng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín halaanu'uumár tlabaá hhohho' ngina tlehhiitiyé', nee tlabaá sirbo/ kudá' taa qaalín, hhafeetaá gwa/aatá' awa ta tleehhamo hhe'eés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miringér yaamaá Tarshishi an tidá' xooslarók nga huwahúp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
